{"id":"1316be710802d6a1","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate.md","title":"Recursively Enumerable Predicate","display":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","aliases":["90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate"],"display":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Predicate","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursively-enumerable-predicate — Recursively Enumerable Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"548e36d75578d019\" href=\"?note=548e36d75578d019\" title=\"90-df-ce-set\">90-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>下文一元比较使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"548e36d75578d019\" href=\"?note=548e36d75578d019\" title=\"90-df-ce-set\">90-df-ce-set</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 的实际程序定义域，覆盖性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(k \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (谓词元数)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^k\">\\(P \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^k\\)</span> (谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{n} \\in \\mathbb{N}^k\">\\(\\vec{n} \\in \\mathbb{N}^k\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元组)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\in \\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\">\\(f \\in \\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)\">\\((k+1)\\)</span>元递归函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_k\\)</span> (recursively enumerable predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}predicate}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec n\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(\\vec n,y)=0\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}predicate}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec n\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(\\vec n,y)=0\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad \\mathrm{RE}_1(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ P=W_e.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad \\mathrm{RE}_1(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ P=W_e.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>给定全递归零点测试 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x,y)\">\\(f(x,y)\\)</span>，依次测试 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=0,1,\\ldots\">\\(y=0,1,\\ldots\\)</span> 得到以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为定义域的部分程序。反过来，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，固定实际计算历史谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x,y)=0\">\\(f(x,y)=0\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1(e,x,y)\">\\(T_1(e,x,y)\\)</span>，否则取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；其零点存在恰好表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_e\">\\(x\\in W_e\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 与部分可计算定义域的等价直接来自所引定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是递归可枚举的</li>\n<li>见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"548e36d75578d019","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"548e36d75578d019","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下文一元比较使用 [[90-df-ce-set]] 的 $\\mathrm{CE}$；$W_e$ 使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的实际程序定义域，覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下文一元比较使用 [[90-df-ce-set]] 的 $\\mathrm{CE}$；$W_e$ 使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的实际程序定义域，覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下文一元比较使用 [[90-df-ce-set]] 的 $\\mathrm{CE}$；$W_e$ 使用 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 的实际程序定义域，覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f \\in \\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}$ ($(k+1)$元递归函数, see [[90-df-recursive-function-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"k \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"P \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec{n} \\in \\mathbb{N}^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"f \\in \\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursively\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}predicate}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_{k+1}\\;\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec n\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(\\vec n,y)=0\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\quad \\mathrm{RE}_1(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CE}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\ P=W_e.","display":true},{"tex":"f(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"y=0,1,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"f(x,y)=0","display":false},{"tex":"T_1(e,x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}_k(P)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1837,"backlinks":[{"id":"6b66927fed54f174","anchor":"r